Package: zufasttest
Title: Consumer Fixture for 'zufast'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Z", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A package in the shape every 'zufast' consumer has: it uses the
    'zufast' headers through 'LinkingTo' alone, with no 'Imports', and must
    keep working with 'zufast' uninstalled. Not for release.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LinkingTo: zufast
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
